artifacts/

# Stylesheets are excluded deliberately, not by oversight.
#
# clients/web's CSS is written one rule per line for short declarations
# (`.gauge { position: relative; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; }`),
# consistently across all seven files. Prettier has no option to preserve that:
# it explodes every declaration onto its own line, which turns scan-report.css
# from 1,318 lines into 2,414 and rewrites 4,621 lines in total.
#
# That is a formatter preference overriding a consistent authorial convention, so
# the convention wins and the gate covers TypeScript only. Revisit by choosing the
# expanded style on purpose in its own commit, not as a side effect of adding a gate.
*.css
